Gabay database migrations

New database:
    alembic upgrade head

Existing database already managed by SQLModel create_all:
    1. Back up the database.
    2. Start this release once so the additive auth tables are created.
    3. Run `alembic stamp head` after verifying the schema.

Create future revisions with:
    alembic revision --autogenerate -m "description"

Review every autogenerated revision before applying it.